#
# Where timed(8) gets the time (timed(5), ADR 0194). With nothing here it
# asks Cloudflare's, Netnod's and PTB's servers over Network Time
# Security, which authenticates every answer, and pool.ntp.org over
# plain NTP only while none of them answers. `service timed reload`
# reads this file again.
#
# NTS servers, by the name of their key establishment server, with a
# port when it is not 4460, asked in turn:
#
#   servers = time.cloudflare.com nts.netnod.se ptbtime1.ptb.de
#
# Plain NTP servers, asked only while no NTS server answers; nothing
# after the '=' asks none, so the time is only ever authenticated:
#
#   fallback = pool.ntp.org
